    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "McGovern Estates is delighted to present No. 14 Seagreen Drive to the market. Ideally positioned within this exclusive development of just 18 properties, No. 14 is a stylishly upgraded and extended three-bedroom semi-detached family home, enjoying a peaceful cul-de-sac setting overlooking a mature communal amenity green. \r\n\r\nThoughtfully extended to the rear and further enhanced by a full attic conversion, complete with its own en-suite shower room, the property offers exceptionally versatile and generously proportioned accommodation throughout. The south and west-facing orientation ensures an abundance of natural light throughout much of the day, with the rear garden and impressive open-plan kitchen, dining and living space particularly benefiting from this desirable aspect. To the rear, a bespoke garden room provides an ideal additional space for a home office, studio or quiet retreat.\r\n\r\nInternally, the property has been finished to a high standard, with stylish herringbone-effect wood flooring extending throughout the ground floor. High ceilings and bespoke cabinetry, complement the contemporary and thoughtfully designed interiors. The location is equally impressive. Overlooking a private amenity green, No. 14 is within easy walking distance of the Blacklion shopping complex, Greystones town centre, harbour and marina. A superb selection of shops, cafés, restaurants and local amenities are close at hand, while the DART station and seafront are also within comfortable distance. Combining generous accommodation, a high standard of finish, excellent natural light and a highly sought-after location, No. 14 Seagreen Drive presents a wonderful opportunity to acquire a stylish and versatile family home in one of Greystones’ most desirable settings.\r\n\r\nExtending to approx. 152.3m2 ( 1,639.3sq.ft. including converted attic) this home comprises an entrance hall with guest WC off, 2 x living rooms, open plan kitchen/dining room, TV room, utility room, three bedrooms, one with en-suite, family bathroom, converted attic room with en-suite and landscaped west-facing rear garden with bespoke garden room currently used as home office.\r\n\r\nGreystones town is within walking distance offering a wonderful selection of restaurants, boutiques, and shops and a large number of highly regarded schools. A host of sport and leisure clubs abound in the area including sailing, rowing, football, rugby, tennis and GAA. \r\nThe Shoreline Leisure Centre and swimming pool is close by, as are a great choice of renowned golf clubs, including Greystones, Powerscourt and Druids Glen.\r\n\r\nGreystones is situated in a stunning location between the coast and the Wicklow mountains, giving easy access to the local beaches, countryside and nearby villages of Delgany, Kilcoole and Enniskerry. The commuter will be delighted at the easy access to local bus services and Greystones DART station which offers Park & Ride facilities. The N11/M50 is also within easy reach making for an easy commute to the city, airport and beyond."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway  \r\nFeature tiled flooring. Guest WC off.\r\n\r\nInner Hallway  \r\nHerringbone laminated wood flooring, carpeted stairs to landing with feature wall panelling, recessed lighting, smoke alarm, alarm panel.\r\n\r\nLiving Room \r\nHerringbone laminated wood flooring,   bespoke cabinetry including shelving, storage cupboards and TV unit, bay window overlooking amenity green, feature bifold doors to kitchen/dining room, smoke alarm.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room\r\nHerringbone laminated wood flooring, fully fitted kitchen, wall and floor based storage cupboards, polished stone countertops, ample countertop space, integrated appliances, stainless steel sink unit, gas hob, extractor hood, utility room off.\r\n\r\nTV Room \r\nHerringbone laminated wood flooring, floor to ceiling feature glass wall and sliding glass wall, 1 x Velux window, vertical radiator, recessed lighting.\r\n\r\nUtility Room\r\nHerringbone laminated wood flooring, plumbed for washing machine and tumble dryer, recessed lighting.\r\n\r\nDownstairs WC\r\nFeature tiled flooring, wash hand basin with storage under, WC, recessed lighting, exterior window, extractor fan.\r\n\r\nLanding\r\nCarpeted stairs to upper landing, recessed lighting.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 \r\nCarpeted flooring, floor to ceiling sliding wardrobes,  overlooking amenity green, en-suite off.\r\n\r\nEn Suite\r\nFully tiled double shower unit with glazed panel doors, mains drench head shower plus seperate telephone hand shower, wall hung wash hand basin with storage, WC, recessed lighting, external window.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 \r\nCarpeted flooring, floor to ceiling built-in wardrobes, overlooking rear garden.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 \r\nCarpeted flooring, overlooking rear garden.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom \r\nTiled flooring, part tiled walls, wash hand basin with under storage, wall mirror with lighting, fully tiled shower unit with mains power shower and telephone hand shower, WC, chrome heated towel rail, recessed lighting, extractor fan. \r\n\r\nUpper Landing\r\nCarpeted flooring, recessed lighting.\r\n\r\nAttic Room\r\nCarpeted flooring, eaves storage, 2 x Velux windows, recessed lighting,  hot press and en-suite off.\r\n\r\nEn Suite\r\nFully tiled, pedestal wash hand basin with under storage, mains power shower with tiled inset shelving,WC,  1 x Velux window, recessed lighting.\r\n\r\nOutside Front\r\nCobblelock driveway, parking for multiple vehicles, electric vehicle charging point.\r\n\r\nOutside Rear\r\nPrivate west facing rear garden, cobblelock paving, Granite steps with steel railings, raised gravel beds with mature planting, solid timberframe and concrete post fencing, exterior tap,  outside socket, garden room.\r\n\r\nGarden Room\r\nBespoke garden room, laminated wood flooring, power, broadband, recessed lighting, electric heating."
      },
